    "sectorKey": "industrials",
    "sectorDisp": "Industrials",
    "longBusinessSummary": "Nihonwasou Holdings, Inc. engages in the sales intermediation of Japanese clothing and accessories. The company provides educational guidance for kimono and sewing; tailoring and sewing of kimonos; Kimono maintenance and sales promotion agency services; and production management consulting services, as well as engages in the wholesale business of Japanese clothing and accessories. It research, develops, and sells kimono accessories; manufactures and sells textiles; and operates the men's Kimono specialty stores. The company was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",
